  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA solid Masonry 3-bedroom 1970s Mediterranean-style terrace home that is absolutely bursting with potential. This authentic blank canvas is ready for you to stamp your imagination and personal style.\r\n\r\nThe spacious, sunny and established private courtyard garden offers an incredible opportunity to design your own outdoor oasis.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n• Prime Location: Enjoy ultimate convenience with the Tamaki Link bus stopping right at your gate.\r\n\r\n• Top Schooling: In-zone for excellent primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\n• Local Amenities: Close to a wide range of shopping facilities, cafes, and beaches.\r\n\r\n• Rare Opportunity: On the market for the first time in over 24 years.\r\n\r\nThis property is a true prize with endless possibilities for for visionary buyers. This is a rare opportunity you won't want to miss; you will kick yourself if you don’t come and take a look!",
